[gd_scene load_steps=19 format=3]

; A story stage on one Prologue board. The TerrainStage exports match scenes/combat/combat.tscn.
; The camera's own attributes switch off the sewer look's depth of field, which is tuned for the
; 16-24 m tactical camera and would blur close shots.
; Grade multiplies the view under the letterbox and the dialogue box; a GradeCue tints it, white
; (#FFFFFF) is neutral and hidden.

